        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Progonat, Kurvelesh, Tepelenë, Gjirokastër County, Albania, Vjosa River, Drino\n- People: Ismet Toto\n- Roles: bureaucrat, publicist, writer, revolutionary\n- Events: 2015 local government reform\n\nFacts:\n- Ismet Toto was born in Progonat in 1908 and died in Gjirokastër in 1937.\n- Ismet Toto was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer, and revolutionary.\n- Progonat was a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality in Gjirokastër County.\n- In the 2015 local government reform, Progonat became part of the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Tepelenë is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County in southern Albania.\n- The town of Tepelenë is on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its confluence with the Drino.",
